<urn:atm:triage:finding/PEEKQUERY-FIELD-SHAPE-DEVIATION-001-AD31>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "PEEKQUERY-FIELD-SHAPE-DEVIATION-001-AD31" ;
  triage:title "Implemented PeekQuery/ReadQuery field shapes deviate undocumented from sprint doc's Exact Interface" ;
  triage:description "AD31-QA-2 (PR #503) req-qa ATM-QA-106, minor. Implemented PeekQuery/ReadQuery field shapes differ from the sprint doc's documented interface (resolved-required identity vs optional overrides) -- arguably a stronger design, but an undocumented deviation from the sprint doc's Exact Interface section. Likely a documentation-only fix (update sprint doc to match shipped interface) rather than a code fix. Record for completeness; assess whether this warrants dev dispatch at all given it may be an intentional/superior design choice." ;
